```

# DESCRIPTION

Tracker's registration of the file chooser with Radharc
(`/svc/windows/chooser`, for a client with `grant windows chooser`).

Protocol `todhchai.radharc.ChooserProvider`, version 7, of library `RadharcIPC`, its messages in the one wire format (wire(6)).

| Method | Kind | Since | Ordinal |
| `register` | call | 1 | `0x3f13ba9e85e07fd1` |

: `register`
  Gives Radharc a channel on which Tracker serves `Chooser`.

